WEBVTT

00:00:55.371 --> 00:01:00.662
with the challenge of their 
ever-expanding big data for decades.

00:01:01.537 --> 00:01:04.663
Fifty years ago,
CERN’s data could be stored

00:01:04.704 --> 00:01:06.538
in a single computer.

00:01:06.579 --> 00:01:08.704
OK, so it wasn’t your usual computer.

00:01:08.746 --> 00:01:12.538
This was a mainframe computer
that filled an entire building.

00:01:14.329 --> 00:01:15.746
To analyse the data,

00:01:15.788 --> 00:01:18.163
physicists from around 
the world traveled to CERN

00:01:18.204 --> 00:01:21.454
to connect to the enormous machine.

00:01:23.163 --> 00:01:26.829
In the 1970′s, 
our ever-growing big data

00:01:26.871 --> 00:01:30.329
was distributed across
different sets of computers